Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:18.76,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}ほら笑って Hi-Five
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.59,0:00:06.16,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}稚嫩的青春 延续向未来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:07.62,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}平凡无奇 平凡无奇 今天也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:09.10,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}和你在一起 Make it fun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:26.47,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}受到起舞的风邀请 去到坡道另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:32.21,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}无边无际的蓝 吸引了我的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.59,0:00:36.86,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}发出声响的 悸动预感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:42.76,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}隐藏的纯白心情 逐渐染上色彩
